blurb = "The print illustrates the step-by-step manufacturing process of Arita porcelain (Imari ware) in Hizen Province (modern-day Saga prefecture). Between the second half of the 17th century and the first half of the 18th century, these ceramics were one of Japan's most vital exports to the West."
